From: ServerOmega <69215510+ServerOmega@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:08:22 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 37/52] WebUI: Friends show team names; Teams list and
 dedicated Edit Team page

- Friends table: Team column (was empty "Online tag") and the team name
  under the friend's name, both linking to that team's edit page
- Teams page is a Friends-style table (name, partner, pilot ID, level,
  online/local, card server, actions) with Your information, cross-server
  create/join, and Add Team in sections above the list
- Clicking a row opens /Cards/Teams/{chip}/{id} with only that team's
  fields (name, BGM, colours, emblem, online toggle, Save, Remove, Back)
- Old Customize ?tab=teams&team= bookmarks redirect to the new pages
- Fix MudLink crash (UserAttributes + aria-label) that hid friend team names
- TagTeamLinks helpers + unit tests (346 total)

Co-authored-by: Grok Bot <grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
